.SS "#define AI_MAKE_EMBEDDED_TEXNAME( _n_)   \fBAI_EMBEDDED_TEXNAME_PREFIX\fP # _n_"
Used to build the reserved path name used by the material system to reference textures that are embedded into their corresponding model files\&. The parameter specifies the index of the texture (zero-based, in the \fBaiScene::mTextures\fP array) 
